{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eca04a921c8d0d2956cf7852b751063a13bd6b62173f729a18b96a1a7ac18280", "ja": "（プロレスコラボ当日が近づいてきた。\n今日は宣伝のため、生放送番組に出演する予定だ）", "zh": "（摔跤联动的日子临近了。今天预定要参加直播节目，为活动进行宣传）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6d2de2489e1a9e6ccc8cd4985ff8efb438e16df10c9669a42fa84652dd0ae0ba", "ja": "{$P$}さーん。本番、\nちょっとだけアドリブ入れてもいいですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～。正式录制时，我可以稍微即兴发挥一下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8cd611c815c7f2dae411f5b024d4e340da1ab217b21394bbc05ebe09e5391ace", "ja": "えっ、今からか？　もう撮影始まるけど……。", "zh": "诶，现在就要吗？马上就要开始拍摄了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "51c838f2eb76f6294aee2bcc68e2a4e648389d9f7b6e942929b6637251f67e4e", "ja": "台本のままじゃなくて、リアリティが大事だって、\nのり子さんが言ってたんですよね～。", "zh": "法子前辈说过，\n不能照搬剧本，真实感才是最重要的呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a38a6c7e107a2407eb35a47a383a7c9aead7f87e9dc3c60ebe9dd3f688d43821", "ja": "プロレスの宣伝なんだから、ちょっとくらい\nアドリブがあったほうがいいかなって♪", "zh": "既然是宣传摔角比赛的广告，我想稍微加点即兴发挥会更好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0f0b7451ce0c349fbbc5b914db573847f298ac36ebb63baeea0a605ced9373be", "ja": "リアリティを出すためにか……。", "zh": "是为了增加真实感吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f8ec5606d1e00c8f78cd2429a3ffbf55c27094880ff5064d852f2214aab065b0", "ja": "あ、司会者さんには、\nナイショにしてくださいね？", "zh": "啊，这件事要对主持人保密哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a8ab21d2c91d697f6d76da1617c44adc3f3b3fc6bf95d3c0ac81be70be8bfcec", "ja": "ちょっとビックリさせちゃうかもしれないけど、\nそのほうが、プロレスっぽいと思うんですよね～。", "zh": "虽然可能会让人稍微吓一跳，但我觉得那样才更有职业摔跤的感觉～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cf7aed90d2547fd67f2cd7e91cb64538e5a3d9a96ceb3494ed61c1312d2b5944", "ja": "翼の言いたいこともわかるけど、\nこっちの一存ではすまないからなぁ……。", "zh": "我也明白翼想说什么，不过这事不能只由我一个人决定啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9d8a873b5bf63f6bb2e827b31e86631e95d73e298cf305c7417ededae05c4b3d", "ja": "この宣伝が評判になれば、\n本番の試合も、もっともーっと盛り上がりますよ？", "zh": "如果这次宣传广受好评，正式比赛也会更加更加热闹哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "41aa012740272722d1e698bc907e6a7c29e627382962ff02b511f5dcad55a668", "ja": "お願い、{$P$}さん！\n……ダメぇ？", "zh": "拜托了，{$P$}先生！\n……不行嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1011_p", "source_sha256": "00382b539ef0bedd5ba928104d55556d3e4499f08f48eccba5f265bd41ed8ebe", "ja": "……わかった。とりあえず、ディレクターさんに\n聞いてみるよ。ダメって言われたら諦めてくれよ。", "zh": "……我知道了。总之，我先去问问\n导演吧。要是对方说不行，你可就得死心了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d74e902487b206dab5a6b347a4b9fae5b2c3da4cee25c4ea4d0596fc65795d2e", "ja": "はーい、わかってまーす！\n行ってらっしゃい、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "好——知道啦！\n慢走，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1013_p", "source_sha256": "09299c4f31fe8f1265200e9c40d9cd2f3c7ee899f85b0e1fc933b10ea413db46", "ja": "（……意外にも、ディレクターさんはノリノリで\nOKしてくれた。翼……頼んだぞ！）", "zh": "（……没想到导演先生居然兴致勃勃地答应了。翼……就拜托你了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1014_null", "source_sha256": "df166b1f96a02f8fddba1f339b570be85d03d17bfcd0892b6848103d5ec4f2b9", "ja": "情報番組　本番……", "zh": "资讯节目　正式录制……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1c7851fb22d54c6c612d6b9f3e0b6e24049fb4587137406836dd520a1f887d87", "ja": "はーい！　平和な番組はここまで。\nここからは、わたし達が番組ジャックしちゃいまーす♪", "zh": "好——！和平的节目到此为止。\n接下来，就由我们来劫持节目啦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1017_dakuandou", "source_sha256": "ff733381a059d71368487d640909a85797a2545b2c723144836d6c51df249d78", "ja": "ヒャッハー！　チャンネルは変えるなよぉ？\nブラウザバックもだぁ！　命が惜しかったらなぁ！", "zh": "呀哈哈！不许换频道啊？\n也不许点浏览器后退！想活命的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1018_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "38d38da16050622e3c8c21dbf5911bcb9a851bbe38eb64b6ff8962fdb03159e6", "ja": "ええっ！？　な、なんですか！？\nこんな展開、台本になかったですけど……あれっ？", "zh": "诶诶！？ 这、这是怎么回事！？\n这种展开，剧本里可没有啊……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2630bc562c2cdc71ff4d4c4f8b727ebd6a84129d4dacc3aa3c545388e6c9c41f", "ja": "邪魔はさせませんよ～？\n闇堂さん、抑え込んじゃってくださーい♪", "zh": "不会让你们碍事的哦～？暗堂先生，把他按住吧——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1020_dakuandou", "source_sha256": "bab54063c525a58feeef81a4f436e20c7a4688a63034bc0f3635ecbdbce8d427", "ja": "ヒャッハー！　暗黒の宇宙から\n抜け出せるやつはいねぇ……ブラックホール固めだぁ！", "zh": "呀哈哈！没人能从黑暗宇宙中逃出去……这可是黑洞封锁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1021_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "7588b5fc6403545dcd2863dca00a5e4d60554d585a416730f67a1cfcf3f7c674", "ja": "えっ、ちょ……ぎゃーっ！？　ギブギブ！", "zh": "诶，等、等一下……呀——！？投降投降！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0723_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d06d6322bf6aa46df20e67f682dfb9a2554555181bab152a7ca8eb1300836257", "ja": "（アドリブのおかげで、臨場感のある宣伝になった。\n評判も上々のようだ……やったな、翼！）", "zh": "（多亏了即兴发挥，宣传拍得很有临场感。\n评价似乎也相当不错……干得漂亮，翼！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
